{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf30a000-01aa-8673-9acb-0fdbb2a04b83",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:35:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:32:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, great, thanks for picking up! This is Tony DeLuca. I'm calling about a streetlight situation on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Tony. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the whole block lost its lights last night! Every one of them, dark from one end to the other. Wonderful when you're trying to walk to your car, let me tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the whole block was out. What street is that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bliss Road. I'm at 250 Bliss Road, the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 250 Bliss. And do you know if it's one pole feeding all of them, or did you notice a particular one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great question! There's a pole right across from my house with a box on it, and that's the one I'd have somebody look at. I'd love for a crew to check that pole. I can't say for sure it's the culprit, but it's the closest one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. I'll put it in as the pole across from 250. Did you try the online form first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did, I did! Got on the website this morning and it hit me with one of those captcha things. Wanted me to click all the squares with crosswalks. Failed it! Twice! I guess I can't tell a crosswalk from a driveway. So I figured, call the human!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, those things get everybody. Calling is just fine, I can enter it right from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! That's great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the light still out this morning, or did they come back on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't seen them in daylight, obviously, ha! But nobody's said anything about them coming back. I'll look tonight when it gets dark and I can call back if it's changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And is the best number for you the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, it's 401-555-0155. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0155. I've got the report for the whole block out on Bliss Road, with a crew requested to check the pole across from 250. It goes to the lighting folks and they'll schedule it from there, usually within a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, that's wonderful, Denise! Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:35:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Tony. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:35:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too! Bye now!"
    }
  ],
